.TH GEXORA 1 "2026-09-27" "Peios"
.SH NAME
gexora \- GXWI file explorer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gexora
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs within a GXWI session. Its parent supplies the session descriptors and identity; launch applications through the desktop.

.SH SEE ALSO
The Peios learn documentation and installed registry manuals.
